Smoke sweep:
- 20 TUNE tasks (16 T1, 4 T2) × 40 stage-1 configurations, giving 800 relational-vs-reference comparisons;
- 0 equivalence failures, 0 strict ranked-list differences, 0 strict answer differences;
- wall time 58 seconds;
- seed match: id 13 tasks, file only 6, none 1.

Median query time, relational vs reference:
- base PPR 76 vs 13 ms;
- budget B2 297 vs 62 ms;
- metapath 72 vs 13.5 ms;
- bfs 0.7 vs 0.2 ms.
Engine time is about equal to wall time.

deviations_from_protocol:
To keep the stage-1 list at exactly 40 configurations, six entries were dropped:
- file granularity with range form;
- hops 5;
- hub indeg above 15;
- the 6-class ladder step;
- PPR with cochange weight 0.5;
- symbol granularity with range form (replaced by symbol granularity with paths form).

needs_from_other_lanes:
Search lane:
- add arms/search/arm.js exporting open(G, opts) that returns {rank, close};
- export a STAGE1 of exactly 40 named configurations from arms/search/sweep.js;
- use the shared pad factor (common/padding.js through the packer) instead of its own fill.

Grader:
- use arms/common/score.js (content rule by default), compare.js and tq_score.js;
- supply references with id, files, defs (path, start, end) and a commit or cluster field;
- move tune_labels.jsonl to wherever the grader keeps its labels.

Graph-arm builders:
- follow arms/common/SPEC.md and read the canonical CSVs from 'run.js canon';
- mark native algorithm variants with 'variant' and arm-only modes with 'x_' names;
- check equivalence with: node arms/common/sweep.js --arms relational,reference,<arm> --list relational.
